# Rule: Trading Strategy - Phased Configuration

## Summary
Defines a multi-phase configuration plan for evolving a trading strategy over time to improve precision and performance.

---

## PhasedStrategyPlan

```yaml
phases:
  - name: Phase 1 - Short-Term
    lookback: 3
    adx: 10
    time_window: "18h"
    volume: "15%"
    trend_check: false
    objective: "Test initial strategy parameters and settings in watch mode for baseline performance evaluation."

  - name: Phase 2 - Mid-Term
    lookback: 4
    adx: 15
    time_window: "12h"
    volume: "10%"
    trend_weight: 50%
    objective: "Evaluate signal quality with adjusted parameters and partial trend consideration."

  - name: Phase 3 - Long-Term
    lookback: 5
    adx: 20
    time_window: "12-16h"
    volume: "10-15%"
    trend_weight: 100%
    objective: "Achieve a target precision of 1.4 or higher through optimal configuration."
